OL,3,ANigeria and Kenya Ebola patients may
OL,4,Ahave crossed paths at Uganda airport,
OL,5,Aofficials say
OL,6,
OL,7,FHealth officials are investigating
OL,8,Fwhether Ebola patients in Nigeria and
OL,9,FKenya may have crossed paths at
OL,10,FUganda's main airport earlier this
OL,11,Fmonth.
OL,13,FBoth travelled through Entebbe airport
OL,14,Fon 3 October, and investigators are
OL,15,Fexamining whether they could have been
OL,16,Fexposed through shared equipment or
OL,17,Fother contact, the Africa Centres for
OL,18,FDisease Control and Prevention (Africa
OL,19,FCDC) said on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
