OL,3,ANigeria and Kenya Ebola patients may
OL,4,Ahave crossed paths at Uganda airport,
OL,5,Aofficials say
OL,6,
OL,7,FDr Wessam Mankoula, the agency's head
OL,8,Fof emergency preparedness and response,
OL,9,Fsaid this was "one of the possible
OL,10,Fscenarios", but stressed that no link
OL,11,Fhad been established.
OL,13,FNigeria is battling its first Ebola
OL,14,Fcase in more than a decade, while Kenya
OL,15,Fhas confirmed nine infections,
OL,16,Fincluding one death.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
